Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,天空为什么是蓝色的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why is the sky blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:04.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们问了同一个小语言模型的两个版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We asked two versions of the same small language model.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:08.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个回答都来自课程团队保存的 Colab 运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both answers come from the course staff's saved Colab run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:11.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原版的回答像教科书\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The original answers like a textbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:14.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的那个，开口先来一句奶酪味十足的问候\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fine-tuned one opens with a cheesy greeting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.43,0:00:17.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用的是授课老师的口吻，然后才解释\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in the instructor's voice, and then explains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看物理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now check the physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.23,0:00:22.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个怪折射，另一个怪水分子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One blames refraction, the other water molecules.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:26.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个都错了：空气分子对蓝光的散射比对红光更强\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both are wrong: air molecules scatter blue light more than red.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,口吻完全变了；事实却没有变好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The voice changed completely; the facts did not get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,聊天模型的习惯也是这样学来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Chat models learn their habits the same way;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:36.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上展示过一个，开口总是 Sure, here's\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the lecture shows one that starts with the words, Sure, here's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:43.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个模型冻结了 5.96 亿个权重，只训练了 115 万个新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This one kept 596 million weights frozen and trained 1.15 million new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:50.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 A100 上用了大约三分半钟，存下来的文件大约 4.6 MB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It took about 3 and a half minutes on an A100, and fits in a file of about 4.6 megabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.97,0:00:53.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那它学到了什么，又没学到什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So what did it learn, and what didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:54.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两条路线来回答这个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two tracks answer that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:59.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 A 走 README：由 Gemini 写一份人设数据集\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track A, the README, Gemini writes a persona dataset
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:01.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再由 Google 替你微调 Gemini\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Google tunes Gemini for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 B 走课程的 Colab\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track B, the course Colab,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:07.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你自己微调一个开源模型，权重留在你手里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}you fine-tune an open model yourself and keep the weights.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.50,0:01:13.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,左上角的进度条显示当前步骤；右上角的灰色标签指向课件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tracker, top left, shows the step; the gray tag, top right, shows the lecture slides.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.37,0:01:16.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看到标签写着 your turn，就暂停，自己跑这条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When a tag says your turn, pause and run the command.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:23.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个限制要说清楚：这段是 2026 年 10 月 31 日录的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One honest limit: we recorded this on October 31, 2026,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:27.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有服务账号密钥，也没有 GPU\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with no service account key and no GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:30.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 里的每条命令都照原样跑了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every README command ran exactly as written;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:34.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要连 Google 的命令都停在缺少密钥这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the ones that talk to Google stop at the missing key,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:36.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些真实的报错我们都保留了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and we keep those real errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:40.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,正常运行的输出来自 README 和课程团队保存的 Colab 运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Working outputs come from the README and the saved Colab run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.32,0:01:45.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要改变模型说的话，有三种办法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}There are three ways to change what a model says.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:49.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 prompt，在你每次提问时改变输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A prompt changes the input every time you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:54.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检索，也就是第 5 讲的 RAG 应用，把查到的文本加进输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Retrieval, the RAG app from lecture 5, adds looked-up text to the input.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这两种都不碰模型本身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both leave the model itself untouched.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.02,0:02:00.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调转的是第三个旋钮：它改的是权重，办法是给模型看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fine-tuning turns the third dial: it changes the weights,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:05.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大量由一个输入和你想要的输出组成的例子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}by showing the model many examples of an input and the output you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:09.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这门课里，通常指的是指令微调\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In this course that usually means instruction fine-tuning:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.51,0:02:11.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条指令和它的回答，成对出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pairs of an instruction and its answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.29,0:02:15.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,人设属于针对特定任务的微调\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A persona is a task-specific fine-tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.25,0:02:18.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对比一个从没做过指令微调的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compare a model that was never instruction-tuned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.51,0:02:21.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 给 OPT 350m 的开头是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook gives OPT 350m the words,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:24.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,“你好，我的奶酪名字是”\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}hello, my cheese name is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:25.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它就这么接着往下写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It simply keeps going:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:29.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,“我的奶酪名字叫奶酪，不知道你是不是在开玩笑”\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}my cheese name is cheese, I'm not sure if you're joking or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:33.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,经过指令微调的模型会回答，而不是续写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An instruction-tuned model answers instead of continuing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,常常还带着一个习惯，比如 Sure, here's\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}often with a habit like, Sure, here's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:39.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们微调后的 Qwen，会以授课老师的方式回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our fine-tuned Qwen answers the way the instructor would.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:45.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是保存的那次运行给我们的一课：风格学得会；事实没有保证\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lesson of the saved run: style is learnable; facts are not guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.53,0:02:50.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个好用的理解方式：微调动的是模型默认的口吻\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A useful mental model: fine-tuning moves the model's default voice;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,RAG 换的是它桌上摊开的那本书\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}RAG changes the open book on its desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.21,0:02:56.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 A 里，Google 训练模型，你一个权重都看不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track A, Google trains the model and you never see a weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:03:01.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 B 里，你在 Colab 的 GPU 上训练一个小 adapter\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track B, you train a small adapter on a Colab GPU,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:02.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,存下来就是你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and it is yours to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.03,0:03:08.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从你的工作区开始，也就是 AC215 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Start in your workspace, the AC215 folder,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 要装好并且在运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with Docker installed and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.86,0:03:15.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 只给了 repo 的链接，所以 clone 它算是额外的一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README only links the repository, so cloning it is an extra step.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:18.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的提示符显示的是你自己的用户名和机器名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your prompt shows your own user name and machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.58,0:03:21.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时用的是画面上的 commit；你的可能更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Recorded at the commit on screen; yours may be newer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:26.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面有两个目录，dataset-creator 和 gemini-finetuner\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside are two folders, dataset-creator and gemini-finetuner,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:28.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,各有同样的六个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each with the same six files.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:32.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 autotrain 目录不在 README 里，所以别动它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The autotrain folder is not part of the README, so leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:35.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步在云控制台里做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 happens in the cloud console.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:39.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,创建一个叫 llm-service-account 的服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create a service account called llm-service-account
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:41.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给它两个角色：Storage Admin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with two roles: Storage Admin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:45.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及 Agent Platform User，以前叫 Vertex AI User\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Agent Platform User, formerly Vertex AI User.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:49.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在密钥那一页添加一个 JSON 密钥，它会下载到你的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Under keys, add a JSON key, which downloads to your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:53.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你留着第 5 讲的那个账号，就直接复用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you kept the account from lecture 5, reuse it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:57.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步：在 repo 旁边建一个叫 secrets 的目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3: make a folder called secrets next to the repository,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:03:58.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不要建在 repo 里面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:04.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把密钥移进去，名字必须正好是 llm-service-account.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Move the key in and name it exactly llm-service-account.json;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.63,0:04:09.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果隐藏了文件扩展名，它可能会变成 .json.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with hidden file extensions it can end up as .json.json.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:12.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的故意留空\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours stays empty on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:13.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看看这会怎样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Watch what that does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么放在 repo 旁边？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why next to the repository?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:19.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放在 clone 外面的密钥，永远不会被不小心 commit 进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A key outside the clone can never be committed by accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:24.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 env.dev 文件从脚本运行的位置往上找两级目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The env.dev file looks two folders up from wherever the script runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:27.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以两个 container 目录拿到的是同一个密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so both container folders reach the same key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:31.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的第 4 步，是这个文件自己的注释暗示的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra step 4, implied by the file's own comments:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:37.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 env.dev 的第 6、7 行填上你自己的项目 ID 和 bucket 名称\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in env.dev, set your own project ID and bucket name on lines 6 and 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.78,0:04:40.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本会把这两项传进 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The scripts pass both into the containers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.43,0:04:45.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 还默认：Agent Platform 和 Storage 的 API 已经启用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README also assumes the Agent Platform and Storage APIs are enabled,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你也有一个自己的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a bucket of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:51.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 bucket 的名称都是全局唯一的，cheese-dataset 是课程的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Bucket names are global, and cheese-dataset belongs to the course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里暂停，把四步都做完\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause here and finish all four steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:05:01.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据集那一节的第 1 步：进入 dataset-creator 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 of the dataset section: go into the dataset-creator folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: sh docker-shell.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:07.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次构建会把所有东西装好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first build installs everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:12.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里网速快，用了 45 秒；你那边可能要几分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here it took 45 seconds on a fast connection; expect a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:15.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果看到 source: not found，修法马上就讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you see source: not found, the fix is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个脚本做了什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What did the script do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:22.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它读取 env.dev，构建 image，再挂载两个目录运行它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It reads env.dev, builds the image, and runs it with two folders mounted:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:27.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个目录变成 /app，你的 secrets 目录变成 /secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this folder becomes /app, and your secrets folder becomes /secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:32.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个环境变量分别带着密钥的路径、你的项目和你的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three variables carry the key's path, your project and your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:36.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 --rm 参数会在你退出时删掉 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The --rm flag removes the container when you exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:41.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对横幅宽容一点：它在激活那一行运行之前就说已激活\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Read the banner kindly: it says activated before the activation line runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:44.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示符也从来不显示 app 前缀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the prompt never shows an app prefix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.69,0:05:45.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个都无害\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both are harmless;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:49.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查一下，Python 来自 /.venv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra check shows Python comes from /.venv,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.27,0:05:51.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的设置也都传进来了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and your settings arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:53.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示符里 app 和 @ 符号后面那一段\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The part after app and the at sign
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.75,0:05:55.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是 container ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is the container ID;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的会不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}yours will differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:58.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步是 README 的提示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 is the README's tip:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.99,0:06:02.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 container 里运行 ls -la /secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}ls -la /secrets, inside the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:06.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，你会在这里看到 llm-service-account.json\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, you'd see llm-service-account.json here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:10.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的只显示目录本身，是故意的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours shows only the folder itself, on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:13.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：python cli.py --help\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: python cli.py --help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:17.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个参数：generate、prepare 和 upload\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three flags: generate, prepare and upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:22.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥也能用，因为代码只在第一次调用 Google 时才去找凭据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It works without a key, because the code only looks for credentials when it first calls Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.13,0:06:24.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，走到这个提示符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and get to this prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:30.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个坑，作为额外的演示，在第二个终端里跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two traps, shown as extras from a second terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.51,0:06:33.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Debian、Ubuntu 或 WSL 上，sh 就是 dash\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Debian, Ubuntu or WSL, sh is dash,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.94,0:06:39.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它没有 source 命令：改用 bash docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which has no source command: run bash docker-shell.sh instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:44.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，在 repo 根目录下，脚本找不到 env.dev\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And from the repository root, the script cannot find env.dev:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.62,0:06:46.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先 cd 进这个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}cd into the folder first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:52.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再来一个额外的：用 docker images 看，有 1.64 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One more extra: docker images reports 1.64 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 lock 文件装了 133 个包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lockfile installs 133 packages,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:07:00.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其中有 RAG 那一讲的 chromadb 和 langchain\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}among them the RAG lecture's chromadb and langchain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:02.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而这份代码从来不导入它们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which this code never imports.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.63,0:07:10.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上讲的指令数据集，每个例子有三部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's instruction dataset has three parts per example:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:14.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条指令、可选的上下文，以及你想要的输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an instruction, optional context, and the output you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:20.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程去掉了上下文：每个例子就是一个问题加一个回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial drops the context: each example is a question and an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:21.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一百组这样的例子，谁来写？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Who writes a hundred of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.29,0:07:24.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另一个模型，也就是教师模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another model, a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:27.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里的教师模型是 Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here the teacher is Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:29.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 global 区域调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}called in the global location.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.87,0:07:33.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它拿到一段描述人设的系统指令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It gets a system instruction describing the persona,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:36.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个要 20 组问答的输入 prompt\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an input prompt asking for 20 pairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个规定回答形状的 JSON schema\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a JSON schema that fixes the answer's shape:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,question 和 answer 两个字段\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}question and answer objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:46.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：python cli.py --generate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: python cli.py --generate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:52.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，只花几美分：README 估计每 1000 次迭代 2 美元\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, it costs cents: the README estimates $2 per 1,000 iterations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.65,0:07:57.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有密钥的话，每一批都打印同一行：密钥文件找不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without one, every batch prints the same line: the key file was not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:08:00.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可退出码却是 0，也就是成功\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And yet the exit status is zero, which means success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记住这个 0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember that zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.57,0:08:07.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步讲的是 system prompt，它就写在 cli.py 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 explains the system prompt, which lives in cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:12.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它要教师模型在每个回答开头用一句授课老师的口头禅\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It tells the teacher to open each answer with one of the instructor's catchphrases,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:15.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,比如 good question，或者 glad you ask\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}such as good question, or glad you ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:20.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它还要求加入热情的感叹语，突出授课老师的个性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And it asks for enthusiastic exclamations, in the instructor's character.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.42,0:08:24.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步是输入 prompt，要 20 组各不相同的问答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3 is the input prompt, asking for 20 diverse pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.83,0:08:30.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 步：迭代次数是第 170 行的一个常量，不是参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 4: the number of iterations is a constant on line 170, not a flag;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,想要更大的数据集，就改它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}edit it for a bigger dataset.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:35.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 temperature 设成 0.9 是为了增加多样性\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Temperature 0.9 adds variety,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.35,0:08:40.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 response schema 让 Gemini 按那个形状返回 JSON\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the response schema makes Gemini return JSON in that shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:44.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，这些文件里会是 README 样例那样的回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, the files would hold answers like the README's samples:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:48.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,“Yello，我是授课老师，你的 cheese monker”\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yello, this is the instructor, your cheese monker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:49.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:54.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 摘录的 prompt 里列出的开场白比 cli.py 的旧\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the README's prompt excerpt lists older openers than cli.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:59.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但 cli.py 自己的样例还是以 Yello 和 Welcome 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but cli.py's own samples still open with Yello and Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:01.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你会看到两样混着出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Expect a mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:03.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,继续之前，先想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One question before we move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:08.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 prompt 要教师模型给出具体细节，比如最适 pH 值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The prompt asks the teacher for specifics, such as optimal pH levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:18.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会变成训练目标\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It becomes a training target.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:23.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学生模型学着把它说出来，说得很自信，用的是授课老师的口吻\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The student learns to say it, confidently, in the instructor's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:28.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,合成数据会带上教师模型的错误，所以要检查教师模型写了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Synthetic data carries the teacher's mistakes, so check what the teacher wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:31.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在到 prepare 那一节的第 1 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now step 1 of the prepare section,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:34.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学生跑完刚才那条，接着就会敲它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as a student would type it right after that run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:38.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入这条命令：python cli.py --prepare\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type python cli.py --prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:42.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,0 个错误，形状是 0 乘 0，然后崩溃\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Zero errors, a shape of zero by zero, and then a crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:47.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 cli.py 第 243 行报 KeyError: 'question'\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}KeyError: 'question', from line 243 of cli.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:48.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,往回追\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Trace it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:52.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 generate 里，每一批都在一个 try 块里运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In generate, each batch runs inside a try block,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.36,0:09:57.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 200 行的 except 会捕获任何异常，打印出来，然后继续\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the except on line 200 catches any exception, prints it, and carries on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:10:02.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以一个文件都没写出来，这条命令却还是以 0 退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So no file was written, and the command still exited with zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.27,0:10:05.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次 prepare 没找到文件，就建了一张空表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prepare found no files, built an empty table,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.14,0:10:09.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一次读 question 列就失败了。错误一直都在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and failed the first time it read the question column. The error
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.57,0:10:13.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那个全捕获的 except 只是把它推迟到了下一条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}was there all along; the catch-all only moved it one command later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:16.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看输出的内容，别只看退出码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Read the lines, not the exit code.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:20.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修法就是密钥本身：把它放进 secrets 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is the key itself: put it in the secrets folder
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.53,0:10:24.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,名字要完全一致，再用这条命令检查：ls -la /secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the exact name, and check with ls -la /secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为了看一次真实的运行，额外加一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So we can watch a real run, an extra:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.49,0:10:30.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五个手写的文件，标着 scripted\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}five hand-written files, tagged scripted,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:33.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,形状和 Gemini 返回的完全一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in exactly the shape Gemini returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:37.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,里面一共 20 组，Gemini 会写一百组左右\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They hold 20 pairs, where Gemini would write about a hundred;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 generate 会写出它自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your generate writes its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:43.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,注意失败的那次运行留下的 1 字节 CSV\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Note the 1-byte CSV the failed run left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.32,0:10:44.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在再跑一次 prepare\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now prepare again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:49.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,处理了五个文件，0 个错误，形状是 19 乘 2\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five files processed, zero errors, and a shape of 19 by 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:53.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一组脚本数据故意重复了第一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last scripted pair repeats the first question on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.85,0:10:57.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 233 行的 drop duplicates 把它去掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}drop_duplicates on line 233 removed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:00.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个回答都以一句口头禅开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every answer opens with a catchphrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.28,0:11:03.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些行保存成 instruct-dataset.csv\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The rows are saved as instruct-dataset.csv:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.56,0:11:06.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文件名里用的就是课上的术语\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the lecture's term, in the file name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.70,0:11:09.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍 generate 和 prepare\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run generate and prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.83,0:11:15.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是 prepare 那一节的第 2 步，讲的是格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2 of prepare is about format.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跟着一组问答走一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Follow one pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:18.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它一开始是 CSV 里的一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It starts as a CSV row.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.23,0:11:25.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 241 到 247 行把它拼成一段文本，加上 human 和 bot 标记\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 241 to 247 glue it into one text with human and bot labels,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.21,0:11:30.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是 repo 里 autotrain 目录读的那个 text 列\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the text column the repository's autotrain folder reads.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:32.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 A 用不到它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Track A doesn't use that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:37.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 251 到 257 行构造出 Gemini 微调要的格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lines 251 to 257 build what Gemini tuning expects:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:42.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个叫 contents 的列表，里面有 user 这一轮和 model 这一轮\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a list called contents, with a user turn and a model turn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:44.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一轮都带着 parts 和 text\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each holding parts and text.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:47.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外看一眼真正的 train.jsonl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra look at the real train.jsonl:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:53.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,嵌套方式和 README 的例子一样，只是每个样本只占一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same nesting as the README's example, but each example on a single line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:57.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 JSONL 里的 L：JSON lines\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the L in JSONL: JSON lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:12:02.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 train test split 用固定的随机种子留出 10%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then train_test_split holds out 10 percent with a fixed seed:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:08.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,17 个样本放进 train.jsonl，2 个放进 test.jsonl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}17 examples in train.jsonl, 2 in test.jsonl, which the tuning job
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:10.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调任务拿它们做验证\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}uses for validation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:15.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码注释说 Gemini 最多接受 256 个验证样本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The code's comment says Gemini accepts at most 256 validation examples,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:17.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以才有这个上限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}hence the cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:24.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不管外面怎么包装，训练的仍然是预测下一个词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Whatever the wrapping, training is still next-word prediction,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.94,0:12:26.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只不过现在预测的是授课老师的回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}now on the instructor's answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外从笔记本这边看一眼\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra from the laptop side:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.41,0:12:33.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 bind mount 把这些文件留在了你的 clone 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the bind mount left these files in your clone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:36.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 git status 看，data 目录是被忽略的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git status shows the data folder as ignored,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:38.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以它不会进到你的 commit 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so it stays out of your commits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:43.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一节是 upload：python cli.py --upload\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next section, upload: python cli.py --upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次它失败得很明显\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This time it fails loudly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:48.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,报的是 DefaultCredentialsError：文件找不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a DefaultCredentialsError: file not found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.70,0:12:51.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，README 也没写会输出什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, no output is documented.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.53,0:12:54.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要找的是每个文件一行、以 Uploading file 开头的输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look for one line per file starting with Uploading file,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:57.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共五行，然后去你的 bucket 里找到它们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}five in all, then find them in your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:13:01.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：README 从没说要建这个 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README never says to create that bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:03.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 upload 默认它已经存在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and upload assumes it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:05.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先把它建好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Make it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:08.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你刚改过 env.dev，就重启 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you just changed env.dev, restart the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后暂停，上传\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then pause and upload.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:15.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是微调那一节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On to the fine-tune section.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:18.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入 exit，container 会自己删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type exit; the container removes itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:22.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一个 docker ps -a，什么都没剩下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and an extra docker ps -a shows nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.44,0:13:25.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：进入 gemini-finetuner 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: go to the gemini-finetuner folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:28.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 漏掉了一个额外的修改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra edit the README leaves out:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:32.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 10、11 行还指向课程的 bucket，cheese-dataset\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}lines 10 and 11 still point at the course bucket, cheese-dataset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:36.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只把 cheese-dataset 换成你的 bucket 名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Replace only cheese-dataset with your bucket name;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:39.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,目录 llm-finetune-dataset-small 保留不动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}keep the folder, llm-finetune-dataset-small,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:41.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,upload 就把文件放在那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where upload put the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:46.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个目录挂载进了 container，所以不用重新构建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The folder is mounted into the container, so there's no need to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:49.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：再跑一次 sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: sh docker-shell.sh again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一下就好了：uv sync 之前的每一层都有缓存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's instant: every layer up to uv sync is cached,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:58.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为两个目录共用同一个 Dockerfile、pyproject 和 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because both folders share the same Dockerfile, pyproject and lockfile,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一个 diff 就能看到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as an extra diff shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:07.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python cli.py --help 显示两个参数，train 和 chat\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}python cli.py --help shows two flags, train and chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:11.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,负责训练的客户端在 us-central1 创建微调任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The train client creates tuning jobs in us-central1.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:16.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,负责聊天的客户端调用多区域 us 里的微调后的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The chat client calls the tuned model in the multi-region location us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.33,0:14:17.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用的是它自己的地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at its own address.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:22.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 train 函数把你 bucket 里的文件包装成微调数据集\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The train function wraps your bucket files as tuning datasets,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:25.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要求跑一个 epoch，adapter 大小为 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and asks for one epoch and an adapter of size four.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:29.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按我们的理解，这就是那个思路的 Google 托管版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}By our reading, that's Google's managed version of the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.58,0:14:31.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你会在第二部分亲手搭建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}you'll build in part 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:33.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次调用就启动了这个任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One call starts the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:39.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调模型那一节的第 1 步：python cli.py --train\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 of the fine-tune model section: python cli.py --train.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:41.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,实验性警告没有关系\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The experimental warning is harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:44.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是缺少密钥：没有创建任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the missing key: no job was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:48.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要找的是 Training job started\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With a key, look for Training job started,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:49.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个在 us-central1 的任务名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a job name in us-central1,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:52.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一分钟后还有 Tuned model info: None\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and after a minute, Tuned model info: None.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:56.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里 main 调用 train 时把 wait for job 设为 false\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Main calls train with wait_for_job=False,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:15:01.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这条命令交了任务就走，就像在干洗店拿一张取衣单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the command hands in the job and leaves, like a ticket at the dry cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:06.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停之前，先看价格表，不到一分钟就会出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you pause, watch the cost table, coming up in under a minute;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:08.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后再回来启动你的任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then come back and start your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:13.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练需要的显存比笔记本多得多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Training needs far more GPU memory than a laptop has;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:15.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，那是 Google 要操心的事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}here that's Google's problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:20.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：在控制台里盯着这个任务，直到它显示 succeeded\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: watch the job in the console until it says succeeded,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.23,0:15:22.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并且有了微调后的模型和一个 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with a tuned model and an endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.78,0:15:24.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A question to pause on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:37.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Google 位于 us-central1 的硬件上，直接读取你的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Google's hardware in us-central1, reading your bucket directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.94,0:15:41.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉 container 不会丢任何东西：它只是提交了任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Deleting the container loses nothing: it only submitted the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.93,0:15:46.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,费用那一节的第 1 步：README 里的价格表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1 of the cost section: the README's table.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:50.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按每千个 token 0.008 美元算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At $0.008 per thousand tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.95,0:15:55.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,16444 个文档跑 3 个 epoch\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}16,444 documents over 3 epochs come
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.36,0:15:58.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共 112.73 美元\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to $112.73; the table calls
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.76,0:16:01.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,表里说这数据太多了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that way too much data.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.98,0:16:05.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,88 个文档大约 57 美分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}88 documents cost about 57 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:10.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：这张表算的是 Gemini 1.5 Flash 跑 3 个 epoch\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the table prices Gemini 1.5 Flash for 3 epochs,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.66,0:16:14.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而代码微调的是 Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite，跑 1 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}while the code tunes Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite for 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.28,0:16:19.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些数字就当是过时的，去看 README 链接的价格页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Treat these numbers as stale and check the pricing page the README links.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.85,0:16:22.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,聊天之前，还有一个额外的修改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you chat, one more extra edit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:26.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 107 行写的还是授课老师的 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 107 still holds the instructor's endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.74,0:16:29.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从控制台复制你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy yours from the console:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.02,0:16:33.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个以 locations、us、endpoints 和一个 ID 结尾的路径\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a path ending in locations/us/endpoints and an ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.42,0:16:34.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它贴到那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Paste it there;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:38.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,否则 chat 会指向授课老师的 endpoint，你的密钥访问不了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}otherwise chat points at the instructor's endpoint, which your key can't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:42.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：python cli.py --chat\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: python cli.py --chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:44.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会打印它的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It prints its question,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.30,0:16:47.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,“希腊的奶酪是怎么做的，用授课老师的方式回答”\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}how is cheese made in Greece, answered the instructor's way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.25,0:16:52.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后打印部署区域 us，还有同样的缺少密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it prints the serving location, us, and the same missing key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.81,0:16:55.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，填好你的 endpoint 之后跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it once your endpoint is in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.56,0:17:01.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 展示了一个能用的 endpoint 对一个旧问题的回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README shows a working endpoint's answer to an older question:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:03.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,开场白同样是 Yello\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same Yello opener.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:05.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的回答会不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your answer will differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:08.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 步是托管的演示，可选。第 4 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 3, the hosted demo, is optional. Step 4:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.70,0:17:14.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,控制台的训练监控会显示你这次任务的 loss 曲线和数据分布\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the console's training monitor shows your job's loss curves and its data distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.63,0:17:18.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是路线 A：教师模型写数据，Google 跑任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's track A: a teacher wrote the data, Google ran the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.33,0:17:20.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你有一个 endpoint 可以调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and you have an endpoint to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.65,0:17:22.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而你一个权重都没见过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And you never saw a single weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:25.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分，权重就在你自己手里了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In part 2, the weights are in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:29.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分在课程的 Colab 里做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 happens in the course Colab,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Tutorial - Finetuning with QLoRA\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tutorial - Finetuning with QLoRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:36.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从这一讲的 Ed 课程页面打开它，链接就在屏幕上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open it from the lecture's Ed lesson; the link is on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:40.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先点 File，再点 Save a copy in Drive；原版是只读的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First: File, Save a copy in Drive; the original is view-only.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.91,0:17:44.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后点 Runtime，再点 Change runtime type，选一个 GPU\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then: Runtime, Change runtime type, and pick a GPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,免费的 T4 就够了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A free T4 is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.43,0:17:52.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 节 pin 住 transformers、bitsandbytes 和 trl\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 3 pins transformers, bitsandbytes and trl,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:55.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并卸载 torchao，notebook 里说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and removes torchao, which, the notebook notes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:58.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有它在的话 peft 不肯添加 LoRA 层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}makes peft refuse to add LoRA layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:18:02.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 节需要一个免费的 Hugging Face token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 4 needs a free Hugging Face token:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Hugging Face 网站上打开 Settings\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on huggingface.co, open Settings,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:08.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再点 Access Tokens，建一个只读的 token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then Access Tokens, make a read token,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:11.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,存进 Colab 的 Secrets，命名为 HF token\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and save it in Colab secrets as HF_TOKEN.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.81,0:18:16.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5 节导入这些库，打印版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 5 imports the libraries, prints the versions,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:20.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时是 torch 2.11 和 transformers 5.16\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the time of recording torch 2.11 and transformers 5.16,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:22.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后挂载你的 Drive\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and mounts your Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:25.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6 节把两个模型都缓存到那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 6 caches both models there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.64,0:18:27.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑完 Part A\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run part A.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在来看课上的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the lecture's question.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么不干脆训练所有权重？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why not simply train all the weights?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:37.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,拿一个 100 亿参数、用 16 位浮点数存的模型来说\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Take a model with 10 billion parameters in 16-bit floats:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:40.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,光是权重就要 20 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the weights alone take 20 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:52.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,梯度每个权重一个，又要 20 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The gradients, one per weight, take another 20 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.91,0:18:57.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Adam 优化器还要给每个权重保留两个滑动平均\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the Adam optimizer keeps two running averages per weight
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:18:59.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 32 位浮点数存：80 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in 32-bit floats: 80 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.78,0:19:07.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一共 120 GB，相当于五块 24 GB GPU 的显存，这还没算激活值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's 120 in total, the memory of five GPUs with 24 gigabytes each, before any activations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.91,0:19:13.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,LoRA 只训练小小的 adapter，所以梯度和优化器状态几乎没了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}LoRA trains only small adapters, so gradients and optimizer states nearly vanish,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:17.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但冻结的基座还得待在显存里做前向传播\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the frozen base still sits in memory for the forward pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:20.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上估计这部分大约 40 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture puts that at about 40 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:26.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,QLoRA 把基座用 4 位存储，课上算出的总量降到大约 12 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}QLoRA stores the base in 4 bits, and the lecture's total drops to about 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来几章讲的就是这三根柱子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next chapters are those three bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:34.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,量化就是把一个区间分成若干个桶\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Quantization means splitting a range into buckets
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:37.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只记下每个数落进了哪个桶\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and storing only which bucket a number fell into.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.77,0:19:42.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上先讲 LoRA；我们跟着 notebook 走，它先做量化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture builds LoRA first; we follow the notebook, which quantizes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:51.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 27、55.3 和 83.78 取整：27、55 和 84\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Round 27, 55.3 and 83.78 to whole numbers: 27, 55 and 84.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:54.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,取整到十位：30、60 和 80\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Round to tens: 30, 60 and 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.78,0:19:58.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,桶越少，需要的位数越少，丢掉的细节也越多\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Fewer buckets need fewer bits, and lose more detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:20:01.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的例题用的是 absmax\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's worked example uses absmax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:09.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 1.5 到 10.2 的十个数，都乘以 127 除以最大值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ten values from 1.5 to 10.2 are multiplied by 127 over the largest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.64,0:20:13.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 10.2 正好落在 127 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so 10.2 lands exactly on 127.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.51,0:20:21.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后每个数取整：1.5 变成 19，5.6 变成 70\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then each value rounds to an integer: 1.5 becomes 19, and 5.6 becomes 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:27.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再除回去，19 变成 1.526，70 变成 5.622\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Divide back, and 19 becomes 1.526, 70 becomes 5.622.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:33.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那些红色的小缺口就是反量化误差：量化总会丢一点东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those small red gaps are the dequantization error: quantization always loses a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:38.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件上写的是 18 和 69；四舍五入应该是 19 和 70\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The slide shows 18 and 69; rounding gives 19 and 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.11,0:20:41.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,整个矩阵只用一个常数有风险\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One constant for a whole matrix is risky:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:45.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个很大的权重会挤掉其他所有权重的精度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one large weight squashes everyone else's precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:51.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 bitsandbytes 给每块 64 个权重单独存一个 absmax 常数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So bitsandbytes keeps one absmax constant per small block of 64 weights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:53.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,4 位能表示 16 个级别\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four bits give 16 levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:57.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,权重呈钟形分布，所以 4 位 NormalFloat，也就是 NF4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Weights are bell-shaped, so 4-bit NormalFloat, NF4, puts them
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.99,0:21:01.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把级别放在分位数上：零附近密，两端稀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at quantiles: dense near zero, sparse in the tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:06.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个权重存成一个 4 位的索引；两个正好装进一个字节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each weight is stored as a 4-bit index; two of them fit in one byte.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:11.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些每块的常数加起来也不少，所以双重量化把它们也量化了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those block constants add up, so double quantization quantizes them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:16.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上跳过了它；notebook 把它打开了，就在这里，NF4 旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture skips it; the notebook turns it on, right here, beside NF4.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:21.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 4 位存，用 16 位算：每次做矩阵乘法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stored in 4 bits, computed in 16: for each matrix multiply,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:26.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一层的权重都会展开成一份 16 位的副本，用完就丢\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the layer's weights are expanded to a 16-bit copy, used, then dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.26,0:21:29.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上用 BF16 计算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture computes in BF16;
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:34.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 用 FP16，训练那一章会解释原因\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this notebook in FP16, as the training chapter explains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.56,0:21:37.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Part B 的第 1 节把小的 OPT 模型打印出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 1 of part B prints the small OPT model:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:40.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个线性层现在都是 Linear4bit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every linear layer is now Linear4bit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.43,0:21:44.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 embedding 和输出头保持原样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}while the embeddings and the output head stay as they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.87,0:21:47.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 节还把一句话分词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 1 also tokenizes a short prompt,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.94,0:21:52.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 节生成我们前面见过的那段续写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and section 2 generates the continuation we met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.55,0:21:54.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑完 Part B\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run part B.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:22:01.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有两个误解要丢掉：4 位模型并不做 4 位运算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two misconceptions to drop: a 4-bit model does not do 4-bit arithmetic,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:04.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,省下来的是显存，不是速度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the win is memory, not speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.10,0:22:09.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Part C 的第 1 步加载真正的学生模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part C, step 1, loads the real student,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:13.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Qwen3 0.6B，用的是同样的 4 位配方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Qwen3 0.6B, with the same 4-bit recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:17.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着 prepare model for k-bit training 冻结所有权重\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then prepare_model_for_kbit_training freezes every weight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.23,0:22:22.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并打开梯度检查点，这是一个省显存的技巧，训练那一章会讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and turns on gradient checkpointing, a memory trick the training chapter shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.48,0:22:28.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2.1 节数参数：3.758 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 2.1 counts the parameters: 375.8 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:33.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可 Qwen3 0.6B 有 5.96 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But Qwen3 0.6B has 596 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.13,0:22:45.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,线性层里的 4.4 亿个权重\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 440 million weights in linear layers
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.35,0:22:50.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每两个 4 位的值打包进一个字节，所以只算 2.2 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}are packed two 4-bit values to a byte, so they count as 220 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.13,0:22:57.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1.556 亿个 embedding 权重和归一化层都没有量化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The 155.6 million embedding weights and the norms are not quantized.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:23:00.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加起来：3.758 亿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add them up: 375.8 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.20,0:23:04.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置在 2.2 里，确认用的是 NF4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The configuration, in 2.2, confirms NF4.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.20,0:23:09.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 2.3 里，基座模型续写一句话，写着写着就跑题了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In 2.3 the base model continues a sentence, and it drifts off topic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:13.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 2.4 数可训练参数：0 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And 2.4 counts trainable parameters: zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.03,0:23:15.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全都冻结了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Everything is frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.48,0:23:18.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 的第 3 步准备数据\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook's step 3 prepares the data.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.30,0:23:23.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它下载一个 23 MB 的文件，从中抽取 1000 组问答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It downloads a 23 megabyte file and samples 1,000 pairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.20,0:23:27.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,看一行：contents，user 这一轮，model 这一轮\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Look at a row: contents, a user turn, a model turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.15,0:23:32.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这和路线 A 的格式一模一样：第一部分的那块砖，到了这里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's exactly the format of track A: the brick from part 1 arrives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:37.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3.5 节让 tokenizer 写出 Qwen 的聊天模板\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 3.5 lets the tokenizer write Qwen's chat template:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.20,0:23:42.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,im start user，问题，im end，im start assistant\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}<|im_start|>user, the question, <|im_end|>, <|im_start|>assistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.25,0:23:45.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个空的 think 块，然后是回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an empty think block, and the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.39,0:23:49.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,空的 think 块就是 Qwen3 不思考、直接回答的方式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The empty think block is how Qwen3 answers without thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.51,0:23:51.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,之后聊天也用同样的前缀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and chat uses the same prefix later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.23,0:24:00.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3.6 节分出 900 个训练、100 个测试，3.7 检查一个样本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 3.6 splits 900 for training and 100 for testing, and 3.7 checks one example.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.79,0:24:02.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后这条带子变成整数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the ribbon becomes integers,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.85,0:24:06.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 loss 覆盖每一个 token，连问题和模板也算在内\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the loss covers every token, question and template included.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:09.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说到底还是预测下一个词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's still next-word prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.36,0:24:11.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把第 1 到第 3 步跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run steps 1 to 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.83,0:24:19.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数高效微调只训练一小部分，其余的冻结\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Parameter-efficient fine-tuning trains a small part and freezes the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.67,0:24:26.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把这些方法分成三大类：加性、选择性和重参数化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture sorts the methods into three families: additive, selective and reparameterization.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.42,0:24:28.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,LoRA 属于重参数化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}LoRA is a reparameterization.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.98,0:24:30.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先从小的说起\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Start small.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.35,0:24:33.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 5 乘 5 的矩阵有 25 个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A 5 by 5 matrix has 25 numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:36.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 5 乘 1 的列乘以一个 1 乘 5 的行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A 5 by 1 column times a 1 by 5 row
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.83,0:24:41.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也能得到 5 乘 5 的矩阵，只用 10 个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}also makes a 5 by 5 matrix, from only 10 numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.65,0:24:44.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是秩为 1；秩为 2 需要 20 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's rank 1; rank 2 needs 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.41,0:24:46.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个尺寸上，几乎省不了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At this size it's barely a saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.73,0:24:48.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到了真实尺寸，就不一样了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At real size it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.84,0:24:56.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Qwen 的 query 投影，是 2048 乘 1024 的矩阵：200 多万个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Qwen's query projection is a 2,048 by 1,024 matrix: over 2 million numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.35,0:24:59.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,秩为 8 的一对细条\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A rank 8 pair of strips,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.88,0:25:05.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,2048 乘 8 和 8 乘 1024，一共 24576 个数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}2,048 by 8 and 8 by 1,024, holds 24,576.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:10.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 LoRA 分解的是更新量，不是权重\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So LoRA decomposes the update, not the weights.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.31,0:25:14.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,新的这一层，就是冻结的 W₀\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The new layer is the frozen W₀,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.33,0:25:16.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上 alpha 除以 r，再乘以 B 乘 A\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus α/r, times B times A.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.19,0:25:19.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只训练 B 和 A\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only B and A are trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.25,0:25:21.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,B 从 0 开始，A 随机初始化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}B starts at zero and A at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.00,0:25:27.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上从正态分布里取 A；这个库用的是均匀分布\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture draws A from a normal distribution; the library uses a uniform one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.95,0:25:31.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,关键是 B 乘 A 一开始正好是 0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What matters is that B times A starts at exactly zero,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.60,0:25:34.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以第 0 步的模型就是预训练的那个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so at step zero the model is the pretrained one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.16,0:25:37.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个分支的输出相加\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both branches' outputs add.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.23,0:25:42.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是 notebook 的第 4 步，LoRA 配置：alpha 16，秩 8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the notebook's step 4, the LoRA config: alpha 16 and rank 8,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.56,0:25:48.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以更新量缩放 2 倍，再加上 0.1 的 dropout 做正则化\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the update is scaled by 2, plus a dropout of 0.1 for regularization.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.79,0:25:50.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.18,0:25:53.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪些层？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which layers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.57,0:25:57.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配置里没有写 target modules。所以对 Qwen3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The config names no target_modules. So for Qwen3,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.24,0:26:02.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,PEFT 库的默认设置改的是 query 投影和 value 投影\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the PEFT library's default adapts the query and value projections:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.15,0:26:05.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,28 层里每一层七个矩阵中的两个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}two of the seven matrices in each of the 28 blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.26,0:26:13.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是每层 40960 个，一共 1146880 个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's 40,960 per block, 1,146,880 in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.03,0:26:17.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的表把整个模型当成一个方形的层\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's table treats a whole model as one square layer;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.66,0:26:19.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,真实的数量取决于这些形状\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the real count depends on these shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.30,0:26:21.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在，你自己试试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now, try it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.61,0:26:36.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,秩为 16 会翻倍，变成 2293760\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Rank 16 doubles it, to 2,293,760.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.76,0:26:42.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,七个投影矩阵全用秩 8，是 5046272\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All seven projections at rank 8 give 5,046,272.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.22,0:26:46.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,秩越大，容量越大，代价是更多的显存和时间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}More rank buys capacity at more memory and time;
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.77,0:26:50.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,做人设的话，两个投影矩阵上用秩 8 就够了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for a persona, rank 8 on two projections is plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.86,0:26:54.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要试的话，先在 1.3 重新加载模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To try it, reload the model in 1.3 first.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.45,0:26:59.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到显存柱，按 Qwen 的大小，用我们自己的估算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to the memory column, at Qwen's size, by our own estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:04.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全参数微调大约要 7 GB，还没算激活值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Full fine-tuning would need about 7 gigabytes before activations;
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.35,0:27:06.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 的 QLoRA，不到 1 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this notebook's QLoRA, under 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.86,0:27:12.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,参数只有 6 亿的话，就算全参数微调，也放得进一块 T4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At 0.6 billion parameters, even full fine-tuning would fit a T4.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.32,0:27:13.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这套配方之所以重要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The recipe matters
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.59,0:27:16.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是因为同一个 notebook 能扩展到放不进去的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the same notebook scales to models that wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.98,0:27:20.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,剩下的显存给了激活值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The rest of the memory goes to activations,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.59,0:27:25.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是每一层在前向时算出来的值，留给反向传播用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the values each layer computes on the way forward, kept for the backward pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.64,0:27:28.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,梯度检查点只保留少数几个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gradient checkpointing keeps only a few
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.18,0:27:32.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其余的在需要时重新计算：用计算换显存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and recomputes the rest when needed: compute traded for memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:35.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4.2 节，训练参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 4.2, the training arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.69,0:27:40.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,序列最长 512 个 token，按长度分组\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Sequences are capped at 512 tokens and grouped by length:
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.17,0:27:45.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,2 个 epoch，batch 大小为 4，学习率是 2 乘 10 的负 4 次方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}2 epochs, batches of 4, and a learning rate of 2 times 10 to the minus 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.23,0:27:49.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,优化器是分页的 32 位 Adam\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The optimizer is a paged 32-bit Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.58,0:27:54.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,分页会在 GPU 显存满了的时候，把优化器状态挪到 CPU 内存里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Paging moves optimizer state to CPU memory when the GPU fills up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.89,0:27:56.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的用不着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Ours never needs to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.63,0:28:01.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后打开 fp16，关掉 bf16\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then fp16 on and bf16 off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.02,0:28:06.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,BF16 保留了 FP32 的范围但精度低一些\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}BF16 keeps the range of float 32 with less precision,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.23,0:28:08.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上做 QLoRA 用的就是它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the lecture uses it for QLoRA.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.26,0:28:14.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,T4 没有快速的 BF16，所以这个 notebook 用 FP16 计算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The T4 has no fast BF16, so this notebook computes in FP16.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.05,0:28:17.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4.3 节构建 trainer\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}4.3 builds the trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.50,0:28:20.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 trainer 会把 adapter 转成 BF16\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The trainer turns the adapters into BF16,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.62,0:28:26.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 FP16 训练处理不了 BF16，所以这个单元格把它们转回 FP32\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which FP16 training cannot handle, so this cell casts them back to float 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.72,0:28:31.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且这个数字证实了我们的算术\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the count confirms our arithmetic:
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.04,0:28:36.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1146880 个可训练参数，占 0.3%\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1,146,880 trainable parameters, 0.3 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:42.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在反向传播里，梯度会往下穿过 W₀，只有 B 和 A 被更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the backward pass, the gradient flows down through W₀, and only B and A are updated.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.77,0:28:48.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,W₀ 在往下传的时候会用到；只是它得不到梯度，也不会被更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}W₀ is used on the way down; it just gets no gradient and no update.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:52.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4.4 节，训练：900 个样本，batch 大小为 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}4.4, train: 900 examples in batches of 4
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.63,0:28:55.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑 2 个 epoch，就是 450 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for 2 epochs is 450 steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.41,0:29:00.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在保存的 A100 运行里用了 3 分 36 秒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}3 minutes and 36 seconds on the saved A100 run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.76,0:29:03.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 说，在 T4 上要 6 到 7 分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook says 6 to 7 minutes on a T4.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.86,0:29:07.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 loss 从 2.0 降到了 1.35\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loss falls from 2.0 to 1.35.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.89,0:29:12.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有第 4.5 节，TensorBoard 会在你自己的运行里显示这些曲线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And 4.5, TensorBoard, shows these curves in your own run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.43,0:29:14.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，开始训练\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and train.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.93,0:29:20.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有效吗？第 5.1 节来衡量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Did it work? Section 5.1 measures it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.69,0:29:24.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,困惑度就是平均每个 token 的 loss 取指数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Perplexity is the exponential of the average token loss:
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.34,0:29:29.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大致相当于模型在多少个等可能的下一个 token 里做选择\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}roughly how many equally likely next tokens the model is choosing among.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.81,0:29:34.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 100 个测试样本、30681 个 token 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On 100 test examples, 30,681 tokens,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.08,0:29:41.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,基座模型的 loss 是 2.65，困惑度 14.15\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the base model has a loss of 2.65 and a perplexity of 14.15.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.51,0:29:45.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的模型：loss 1.39，困惑度 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fine-tuned model: 1.39, and a perplexity of 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.06,0:29:49.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,基座那一行，就是同一个模型放在 disable adapter 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The base row is the same model inside disable_adapter().
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.25,0:29:56.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 adapter 关掉，原来的 4 位模型就回来了，因为 W₀ 从来没变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Switch the adapter off and the original model, in 4 bits, is back, because W₀ never changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.99,0:30:03.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这正是课上讲灾难性遗忘时的要点，也就是学新本事时丢了旧本事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the lecture's point about catastrophic forgetting, losing old skills while learning new ones:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.18,0:30:05.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 LoRA 的话，原来的模型只差一个开关\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with LoRA, the old model is one switch away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.15,0:30:09.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在保存的运行里，基座模型的每个回答都以 The 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the saved run, every base answer starts with the word The.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.03,0:30:13.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的回答以 welcome 或 Yello 开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fine-tuned ones start with welcome or Yello,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.03,0:30:15.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是它训练数据里的开场白\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the openers of its training data.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.41,0:30:19.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那些柱子只是示意；实测的数字就在旁边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Those bars are an illustration; the measured numbers sit beside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.90,0:30:21.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个下降衡量的是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What does the drop measure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.71,0:30:25.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 loss 算的是每一个 token，连问题和模板也算在内\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The loss counts every token, questions and template included.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.77,0:30:31.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它说明这种风格是模型现在预期的，而不是它的回答更正确了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It says this style is what the model now expects, not that its answers are more correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.35,0:30:33.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 5.2 节比较回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}5.2 compares answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.70,0:30:37.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个奶酪问题的回答现在都以 welcome welcome welcome\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both cheese answers now open with welcome welcome welcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.49,0:30:40.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,cheese lovers 开头，用的是授课老师的口吻\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}cheese lovers, in the instructor's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:43.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看天空：口吻学过去了，物理没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the sky: the voice transferred, the physics did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.15,0:30:46.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑完第 5 节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run section 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.28,0:30:49.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两点友情提示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two kind notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.80,0:30:53.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这次比较里，基座是一个全新的 16 位模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In this comparison the base is a fresh 16-bit model,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.23,0:30:57.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是表里那个 4 位的，所以两个基线不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not the 4-bit one from the table, so the baselines differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.37,0:31:02.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另外，课上展示了 LoRA 在一个公开的基准测试上追平全参数微调\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the lecture shows LoRA matching full fine-tuning on a published benchmark;
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.31,0:31:05.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 衡量的是风格契合度，不是回答质量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this notebook measures style fit, not answer quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.52,0:31:09.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 的第 6 步保存你的成果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook's step 6 saves your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.97,0:31:17.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先存 adapter：1146880 个数，用 FP32 存大约 4.6 MB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First the adapters: 1,146,880 numbers, about 4.6 megabytes in float 32,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.54,0:31:21.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,连同 tokenizer 一起存到你的 Drive\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}saved to your Drive with the tokenizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.15,0:31:27.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是合并\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the merge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.49,0:31:31.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 加载一份全新的 16 位基座副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook loads a fresh 16-bit copy of the base and adds
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.37,0:31:32.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 B 乘 A 加进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}B times A into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.17,0:31:38.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是加进 4 位的权重里：在那里，更新量会被舍入回 16 个级别上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not into the 4-bit weights: there, the update would round back onto 16 levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.71,0:31:41.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,合并后的模型大约 1.2 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The merged model is about 1.2 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.11,0:31:45.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果合并时报 torchao 的导入错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If the merge raises a torchao ImportError,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.02,0:31:48.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就重新运行安装单元格，再重启会话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}rerun the install cell and restart the session.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.53,0:31:53.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 6.3 节可以把合并后的模型 push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Section 6.3 can push the merged model
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.41,0:31:56.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,到一个私有的 Hugging Face repo\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to a private Hugging Face repository.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.61,0:31:58.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以你可以交付三样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So you can ship three things:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.43,0:32:02.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个离不开基座的 adapter，一个能独立运行的合并模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an adapter that needs its base, a merged model that stands alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.52,0:32:05.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者 Google 的 endpoint，权重不在你手里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}or Google's endpoint, with no weights in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.03,0:32:12.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,清理。退出 container，用 docker image rm 删掉两个 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Teardown. Exit the container and remove both images with docker image rm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.33,0:32:14.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉你的 bucket 里的数据集目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete the dataset folder in your bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.18,0:32:19.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调后的模型和 endpoint 留到第 10 讲，之后再删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep the tuned model and endpoint for lecture 10, then delete them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.60,0:32:24.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,删掉没用的服务账号密钥，再断开并删除 Colab 运行时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete unused service account keys, and disconnect and delete the Colab runtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.10,0:32:26.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把它们都清理掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and tear down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.72,0:32:30.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回顾一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.27,0:32:32.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改 prompt 和做检索，变的是输入\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Prompts and retrieval change the input;
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:36.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,微调变的是权重，而这里它教会的是口吻，不是事实\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}fine-tuning changes the weights, and here it taught a voice, not facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:41.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 A 里，教师模型写数据，Google 微调模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track A, a teacher wrote the data and Google tuned the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:44.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,路线 B 里，QLoRA 冻结了一个 4 位的基座\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In track B, QLoRA froze a 4-bit base
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.89,0:32:50.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只训练两个细细的矩阵：120、40，再到 12 GB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and trained two thin matrices: 120, then 40, then 12 gigabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.38,0:32:56.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五道题，自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five questions to test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.71,0:32:59.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次微调改变了什么，没改变什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What did this fine-tune change, and what not?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.65,0:33:02.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么 generate 在没有密钥时退出码也是 0？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why did generate exit zero without a key?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.81,0:33:05.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一组问答在变成模板的路上，要经过哪些形状？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which shapes does one pair take on its way to the template?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.14,0:33:09.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么 train 打印出来的是：Tuned model info: None？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does train print Tuned model info: None?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.18,0:33:14.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有，1146880 是怎么来的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And where does 1,146,880 come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.27,0:33:19.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，第 9 讲测试代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, lecture 9 tests code,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.13,0:33:22.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 10 讲会有一个应用调用你的 endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in lecture 10 an app calls your endpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.56,0:33:26.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学习指南和练习都在 MLOps Learning 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The study guide and the exercises are in MLOps_Learning.
